    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of The Lilies\u00a0</strong>is a visual novel-style romantic adventure game about love, loss, and sacrifice.\u00a0Explore a fantasy colonial world together with your love interest in 5 different routes, and reach 15 different endings by deciding if your own motives over the greater good is worth a single sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/d0e618a764cf854352fbfb2435f283f7.avif?t=1755099645\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e87851a5e4290769ca4a4bd01a476450.avif?t=1755099645\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the chieftain-to-be in the small village of Tayabac, your family was counting on you to lead the tribe and take care of your people. But when your hometown is invaded by the Seiyslan\u00a0Empire, you\u2019re left without a home, without a culture, and without a family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You were saved by Lady Sabina, who brought you into her home, with the condition that you join an organization that keeps the Seiyslan people safe. You'll have the chance to meet 5 love interests along the way:\u00a0<strong>Seiji</strong>\u2014your protective\u00a0best friend, <strong>Myo</strong>\u2014the charming rebel leader,\u00a0<strong>Taji</strong>\u2014your mysterious rival, <strong>Laisa</strong>\u2014a cunning pirate, and <strong>Lien</strong>\u2014the conqueror who separated you from your family.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10 years later, when the curses that come only once a century resurface,\u00a0you are tasked to protect the Seiyslan Empire, the very people that took everything away from you, and are\u00a0faced with a choice that forces you to decide on the path you\u2019re willing to take to come to terms with your past. <strong>Who are you willing to sacrifice?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/364b5bad6daa00b27fc97e218700744c.avif?t=1755099645\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Main Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your name, pronouns, and choose the main character you play as (female, non-binary, or male).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/4d5b2de4966aac29fe0cc9bbfc1e5733.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/4d5b2de4966aac29fe0cc9bbfc1e5733.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/4d5b2de4966aac29fe0cc9bbfc1e5733.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Romanceable Routes: Who Will You Sacrifice?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of The Lilies features 5 love interests, each with their own views and personal stories. Get to know the characters and form bonds that may last or falter in the face of conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/f23801996d35e7fb001756e470157763.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/f23801996d35e7fb001756e470157763.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/f23801996d35e7fb001756e470157763.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/906c28c2c4e6db31d26e3145a6985f37.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/906c28c2c4e6db31d26e3145a6985f37.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/906c28c2c4e6db31d26e3145a6985f37.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/6a70e4f760c8ab473a9e95d7d22cfbd9.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/6a70e4f760c8ab473a9e95d7d22cfbd9.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/6a70e4f760c8ab473a9e95d7d22cfbd9.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/c2cad04185399b7ca5cb552512902e9b.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/c2cad04185399b7ca5cb552512902e9b.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/c2cad04185399b7ca5cb552512902e9b.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/06bafab969c72e7721d280ac0a7d7131.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/06bafab969c72e7721d280ac0a7d7131.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/06bafab969c72e7721d280ac0a7d7131.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices Matter, Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine how your story ends, with 15 different endings. Choose based on what you believe is right as you confront your past and resolve your inner conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e46f4ed98d5a5d18eeeb5578a30ebf3b.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e46f4ed98d5a5d18eeeb5578a30ebf3b.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e46f4ed98d5a5d18eeeb5578a30ebf3b.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Ambana</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fantasy world inspired by Southeast Asian culture and history. Discover more about the stories behind the people and explore the rich lore that shaped the society you live in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/d1bd056ffc622291acda83cbb35b8f1f.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/d1bd056ffc622291acda83cbb35b8f1f.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/d1bd056ffc622291acda83cbb35b8f1f.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat enemies, brew potions, and more through mini games woven into your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/e91ea90b2390c85cbaaea242d790265b.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/30d042ebbd2dd84d8108f88f0e6d5f1e.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/30d042ebbd2dd84d8108f88f0e6d5f1e.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
