nce a century resurface,\u00a0you are tasked to protect the Seiyslan Empire, the very people that took everything away from you, and are\u00a0faced with a choice that forces you to decide on the path you\u2019re willing to take to come to terms with your past. <strong>Who are you willing to sacrifice?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/364b5bad6daa00b27fc97e218700744c.avif?t=1755099645\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Main Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your name, pronouns, and choose the main character you play as (female, non-binary, or male).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/4d5b2de4966aac29fe0cc9bbfc1e5733.poster.avif?t=1755099645\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/4d5b2de4966aac29fe0cc9bbfc1e5733.webm?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348900/extras/4d5b2de4966aac29fe0cc9bbfc1e5733.mp4?t=1755099645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Romanceable Routes: Who Will You Sacrifice?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of The Lilies features 5 love interests, each with their own views and personal stories. Get to know the characters and form bonds that may last or falter in the face of conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea